# Cargo.lock is intentionally tracked (this is a binary project, not a
# library) — do not add it here.

# Generated corpus artifacts. `news_generator` (or the `tests/fixture.rs`
# local-fixture test) writes these; they are not source and should not be
# committed. In Kubernetes this whole directory is a PVC.
/data/*.jsonl
/data/*.tv
/data/.cache/

